@startuml
title TMFC031 : Bill Calculation -- eTOM/SID ABE Links

class "Pricing, Discounting, Adjustments & Rebates Application L3" as L3PricingDiscountingAdjustmentsRebates <<eTOM Business Activity>>
class "Applied Customer Billing Rate" as AppliedCustomerBillingRate <<SID Data Entity>>
class "Applied Party Billing Rate" as AppliedPartyBillingRate <<SID Data Entity>>

' eTOM activity <-> SID ABE links. Per the image's own legend, an arrow from the
' eTOM activity towards the SID ABE means information produced by the activity;
' the reverse arrow means information consumed by the activity.
'
' Applied Customer Billing Rate: the image draws this pair as a single
' double-headed arrow, i.e. both directions hold simultaneously.
L3PricingDiscountingAdjustmentsRebates --> AppliedCustomerBillingRate : produces
AppliedCustomerBillingRate --> L3PricingDiscountingAdjustmentsRebates : is consumed by

' Applied Party Billing Rate: the image draws only a single arrowhead, from the
' activity into the entity -- no reverse arrowhead is drawn, so only "produces"
' is reproduced here, not invented as bidirectional.
L3PricingDiscountingAdjustmentsRebates --> AppliedPartyBillingRate : produces

@enduml
